  "description": "<h1>No Aim Overswing</h1>\n<ul>\n<li>Configure the percentage of AimSwing on start-aiming, by 0~100% in F12 menu.<br />\nDefault is 10%, which already makes the swing unable to notice, whatever heavy or low ergo weapons.</li>\n<li>Do not affect random shaking, only the starting aimsway.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>How to Install</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Download the zip package, open it and drag the ‘‘BepInEx’’ folder to merge into your main folder of EFT. The final DLL should locate at “Your SPT path\\BepInEx\\plugins\\xxx.dll”</li>\n<li>To uninstall, just delete the DLL file in that path.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Compatibility</h2>\n<p>This mod only affects your client.<br />\nConflict with Custom Stances, and maybe more. Test on your own.</p>\n",
